Modified distribution: EWU NuGet-search variant
Modification dates: 2026-09-29 to 2026-09-30
Based on Nexspence v2.5.1, commit d5070ba188a8d96d2b3b2539d4762ad8f3b8ba62.
Maintained by: EWU-Infrastruktur-Team.

This variant adds NuGet v3 hosted/group search, metadata catalog and backfill,
registration/version aggregation, bounded remote search, permission filtering,
client-discovery compatibility, and associated tests and build documentation.
It is a modified version, not an unmodified upstream release.
The modified work is provided under AGPL-3.0-or-later, with the license and
warranty terms stated above. Upstream attribution is retained.

Build and source-delivery requirements for this variant are documented in
BUILDING-EWU.md. The source offer must identify the exact deployed revision;
a private development repository or the upstream repository alone does not
constitute that offer to users without access.

Scanner clarification for this variant: the root Dockerfile does not bundle
Trivy. The preceding upstream scanner notice applies if Trivy is separately
included; its license obligations must then also be met.
